# Phase 5 panels: `/status` with no credential on the Gateway, whose profile
# settings were valid at launch and are malformed by the time it opens, so the
# panel says `Settings  couldn't be read: <cause>` where Auth would stand
# (openStatusSnapshot, session_commands.zig:283-296@481104fd). Uses H1's
# `rehomefile`: fx refuses a malformed profile at launch, and xfx does not
# (p5-panels-badsettings captures that launch).
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
env AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
fx: seed h1-settings-ok.json
xfx: seed h1-settings-ok.json
wait 3
snap launch
fx: rehomefile .fx/settings.json h1-settings-bad.json
xfx: rehomefile .xfx/settings.json h1-settings-bad.json
type /status
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap open
key Escape
wait 0.5
snap closed
